ltiline entry"],[762,"**Network connectivity**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[1148,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[684,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[749,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[766,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[759,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1214,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[1213,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[881,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1334,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[2114,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[750,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[745,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[1868,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[1905,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1788,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[1873,"**RTL support*&#x2A;: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences &#x2A;(in development)*"],[1903,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[1900,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1375,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1376,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1430,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[341,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[1934,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[1866,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1329,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[877,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[453,"**Sizes**: Each picker is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, trigger, description, error, and the calendar it opens; without it, the picker follows the surrounding scope"],[1658,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, description, error, and composed controls; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope. An explicit `size` on a part still wins for that part"],[1018,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, steppers, description, and error; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope"],[1332,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets the label, trigger, and options, which open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"],[1765,"**Space / Enter**"],[1219,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[340,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[925,"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"],[1379,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[